  "releaseNotes": "Add Reflection v1 and v1alpha with descriptor dependency lookup, plus opt-in standard gRPC path aliases alongside existing routes. Bind Server.EnableReflection from configuration. Discovery honors Contract.AllowAnonymous; business aliases retain authorization, audit metadata and contract validation. Preserve the 4.0.x wire format and business schema hashes. See CHANGELOG.md and docs/url-routing.md.",
